5GB memory",".5 vCPU and 1GB memory","1 vCPU and 2GB memory","2 vCPU and 4GB memory","4 vCPU and 8GB memory","More"],"hasOpenChoice":true,"id":"7be2426a-682e-4160-a65f-5b4e74e457c8","optional":false,"question":"How much compute does a typical task need?","type":"single_choice"},{"choices":["Yes — I want tasks to finish faster, requiring occasional bursts in CPU and memory.","No — I don't need tasks to finish at a specific time constraint, I prefer, steady, constant CPU, memory.","Other"],"hasOpenChoice":true,"id":"a59e39cb-7802-43aa-9e7e-aa723e1d03b1","optional":false,"question":"Would you pay for more compute to have your task run faster? E.G. Do you need the worker to burst to more CPU/memory temporarily for parallel tasks, or is it a single threaded task and you would prefer cost efficient, constant compute resources?","type":"single_choice"},{"choices":["Just 1","2–10","10–100","100+"],"id":"750cf7da-f3d8-4bd4-8096-9d844d7c5215","optional":false,"question":"At peak, how many of these tasks run at the same time?","type":"single_choice"},{"branching":{"responseValues":{"0":10,"1":17,"2":24,"3":17},"type":"response_based"},"choices":["Mostly waiting (75%+)","A mix of both","Mostly computing (waiting under 25%)","Not sure"],"id":"be2d9277-f6e2-41be-b92c-7a9dcb4974ae","optional":false,"question":"Roughly what share of a task's time is spent waiting on external calls (LLM APIs, other services) versus actually computing?","type":"single_choice"},{"branching":{"responseValues":{"0":"end","1":"end","2":28,"3":28},"type":"response_based"},"choices":["Definitely would","Probably would","Probably would not","Definitely would not"],"id":"2ea3c6ce-e613-4ac4-b2a6-c318942aab9b","optional":false,"question":"At $7 for a 100-hour compute block, would you use Supabase Workers for the workload you described?","type":"single_choice"},{"branching":{"responseValues":{"0":"end","1":"end","2":7,"3":7},"type":"response_based"},"choices":["Definitely would","Probably would","Probably would not","Definitely would not"],"id":"cf9b781c-799f-4746-8db5-2233633686c2","optional":false,"question":"At $10 for a 100-hour compute block, would you use Supabase Workers for the workload you described?","type":"single_choice"},{"branching":{"responseValues":{"0":"end","1":"end","2":8,"3":8},"type":"response_based"},"choices":["Definitely would","Probably would","Probably would not","Definitely would not"],"id":"4baaa843-1008-4beb-a680-cc7962a3da0c","optional":false,"question":"At $14 for a 100-hour compute block, would you use Supabase Workers for the workload you described?","type":"single_choice"},{"branching":{"responseValues":{"0":11,"1":11,"2":9,"3":9},"type":"response_based"},"choices":["Definitely would","Probably would","Probably would not","Definitely would not"],"description":"Thanks for the details! We're exploring a new offering, Supabase Workers — general-purpose compute for longer-running background tasks (AI agents, data pipelines, and more) beyond what Edge Functions supports today. These prices are anchored to a 100-hour compute block at 1 vCPU — if your workload needs more, just scale the price roughly in proportion (e.g. 2 vCPU ≈ 2x this price, 4 vCPU ≈ 4x). A few quick questions on what you'd consider a fair price for that block.","descriptionContentType":"text","id":"3ce4081d-81d1-4995-bca5-556320d129a2","optional":false,"question":"At $20 for a 100-hour compute block, would you use Supabase Workers for the workload you described?","type":"single_choice"},{"branching":{"responseValues":{"0":12,"1":12,"2":"end","3":"end"},"type":"response_based"},"choices":["Definitely would","Probably would","Probably would not","Definitely would not"],"id":"f3e39fb5-8de5-4ed5-b7b1-bba45354bafb","optional":false,"question":"At $28 for a 100-hour compute block, would you use Supabase Workers for the workload you described?","type":"single_choice"},{"branching":{"responseValues":{"0":13,"1":13,"2":"end","3":"end"},"type":"response_based"},"choices":["Definitely would","Probably would","Probably would not","Definitely would not"],"id":"7f7cc1e5-9147-48bf-a037-1724b364abf3","optional":false,"question":"At $40 for a 100-hour compute block, would you use Supabase Workers for the workload you described?","type":"single_choice"},{"branching":{"type":"end"},"choices":["Definitely would","Probably would","Probably would not","Definitely would not"],"id":"30e713bb-b2de-49c8-a9db-82ae65da1771","optional":false,"question":"At $58 for a 100-hour compute block, would you use Supabase Workers for the workload you described?","type":"single_choice"},{"branching":{"responseValues":{"0":"end","1":"end","2":29,"3":29},"type":"response_based"},"choices":["Definitely would","Probably would","Probably would not","Definitely would not"],"id":"559fbd4c-26d4-4f97-9f78-e6a9f20b9315","optional":false,"question":"At $14 for a 100-hour compute block, would you use Supabase Workers for the workload you described?","type":"single_choice"},{"branching":{"responseValues":{"0":"end","1":"end","2":14,"3":14},"type":"response_based"},"choices":["Definitely would","Probably would","Probably would not","Definitely would not"],"id":"c4b86c3b-8b22-47c2-a3d0-3dde4fd287c8","optional":false,"question":"At $20 for a 100-hour compute block, would you use Supabase Workers for the workload you described?","type":"single_choice"},{"branching":{"responseValues":{"0":"end","1":"end","2":15,"3":15},"type":"response_based"},"choices":["Definitely would","Probably would","Probably would not","Definitely would not"],"id":"09b37b3c-c2eb-4807-8a34-3a7a27412475","optional":false,"question":"At $28 for a 100-hour compute block, would you use Supabase Workers for the workload you described?","type":"single_choice"},{"branching":{"responseValues":{"0":18,"1":18,"2":16,"3":16},"type":"response_based"},"choices":["Definitely would","Probably would","Probably would not","Definitely would not"],"description":"Thanks for the details! We're exploring a new offering, Supabase Workers — ge